# Menace: Bot2's lone Elvish Mystic can't block the Inspector (refusal), but the Mystic and the Llanowar Elves together
# can, and do. Bot1 assigns the Inspector's 1 combat damage to the Mystic; the blockers' 2 damage kill the Inspector, which
# deals 1 damage to Bot1 (19) and leaves a Clue. The Mystic is dead, the Elves alive.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Callous Inspector
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island
Island
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Callous Inspector.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Attack(Callous Inspector > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Elvish Mystic > Callous Inspector)
Bot2.Block(Elvish Mystic > Callous Inspector; Llanowar Elves > Callous Inspector)
Bot1.AssignDamage(Callous Inspector > Elvish Mystic: 1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Callous Inspector
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Clue Token
Bot2.Graveyard = Elvish Mystic
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Life = 20
